<title>HONG KONG: China Star 1996 net loss HK$38.3 mln.</title>
<headline>China Star 1996 net loss HK$38.3 mln.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   1.8 loss   vs 0.96 loss (adjusted)</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil	  vs nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  25.95 loss vs 4.53 gain</p>
<p>    Net			    38.30 loss vs 17.62 loss</p>
<p>    Turnover		     33.65	vs 75.15</p>
<p>    Company name		 China Star Entertainment Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  N/A</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - Star Entertainment, formerly Star Entertainment (International Holdings) Ltd, produces, distributes and sells film and karaoke laser discs and videotapes.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional loss of HK$20.82 million on write down of stocks to net realisable value and loss of HK$5.14 million on write off of royalty prepayments.</p>
<p>Comparative loss per share has been adjusted for the rights issue in November 1996.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is nil vs nil.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
